docs {
  # piyo API smoke test

  Every endpoint of the API, in the order of a smoke test. Select an environment, then run the
  folders in order with the collection runner: 1-public, 2-device, 3-admin.

  Variables set by the requests themselves (post-response): datasetVersion, reportId, suggestionId,
  contributionId, deviceHash. Nothing here is sensitive: adminToken is a secret variable stored only
  in your local Bruno profile, never in this folder.
}
